CleanRoom adapts code and test fixtures from morluto/rea
(https://github.com/morluto/rea), commit 46c9cba, MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2026 morluto. Adapted source files carry a header line
"Adapted from rea <path>@46c9cba (MIT, (c) morluto); see NOTICE" and are
